        "content_text": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"565\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?fit=1024%2C565&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"Solitary woman traveling on an open road\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?w=2560&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=300%2C166&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=1024%2C565&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=768%2C424&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=1536%2C848&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=2048%2C1131&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=1200%2C663&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=2000%2C1104&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=780%2C431&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=400%2C221&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?resize=706%2C390&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?w=2340&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2340w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-1288437134-scaled.jpg?fit=1024%2C565&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure>The editor of <em>The Best Women's Travel Writing</em> series on curation, grief and levity, and the stories she hopes to read more of in the future.",
