        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/18/apple-tv-reveals-new-comedy-series-with-matthew-mcconaughey-coming-soon/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/brothers-matthew-mcconaughey-woody.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple TV just <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/tv-pr/news/2026/06/apple-tvs-new-comedy-series-brothers-starring-matthew-mcconaughey-and-woody-harrelson-to-make-global-debut-on-wednesday-september-23/\">announced</a> the release date for Brothers, a new comedy series starring Matthew McConaughey and Woody Harrelson. Here are the details.</p>",
