        "title": "Apple Watch Ultra 4: Four rumored new features coming this fall",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/17/apple-watch-ultra-4-four-rumored-new-features-coming/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/apple-watch-ultra-3-4-mountain.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has a packed lineup of <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/15/apple-will-launch-15-new-products-this-fall-heres-whats-coming/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1048064\">15+ new products launching this fall</a>, including the Apple Watch Ultra 4—here are four rumored new features.</p>",
