        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/sharepower-nimble-iphone.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Nimble, the maker of many interesting iPhone accessories, is launching a new product called SharePower, which it bills as the world’s first sharable battery. Nimble says SharePower will be available in Apple retail stores and on Apple’s website.</p>",
