        "title": "I Let an AI Agent Run 40 Experiments While I Slept",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/i-let-an-ai-agent-run-40-experiments-while-i-slept/",
        "content_text": "I set up an AI agent on a rented GPU, pointed it at a training script, and went to bed. By morning it had run 40 experiments, improved validation loss by 5.9%, and cut memory usage from 44 GB to 17 GB. It also spent four hours chasing a bug that a linter introduced behind [&#8230;]",
        "type": "Technology",
