        "title": "Keir Stymied",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213590/Keir-Stymied",
        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/live/ckger03mrl0t\">Keir Starmer resigns as leader of the Labour Party and as Prime Minister of the UK,</a> saying he'll stay in office until the party decides a new leader.<br/><br/>Andy Burnham, former mayor of Manchester and <a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/live/c3928mlyle8t\">winner of the Makerfield by-election</a> last week, will be sworn in as a new MP this afternoon. Burnham is expected to become the next party leader and prime minister. We don't know yet whether <a href=\"https://www.lbc.co.uk/article/what-wes-streeting-prime-minister-labour-5Hjdbjg_2/\">Wes Streeting</a> will follow through on his intention to stand for leader.",
        "type": "Internet",
